{"id":"ec7ec2b1e34cb9f0","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations.md","title":"Definition — 预层子对象的 Heyting 运算","display":"Definition — 预层子对象的 Heyting 运算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations","aliases":["14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations"],"display":"Definition — 预层子对象的 Heyting 运算","source_ref":"I.8, pp.54–56","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 预层子对象的 Heyting 运算"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.8, pp.54–56"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91189e210bff4156\" href=\"?note=91189e210bff4156\" title=\"14-df-heyting-algebra\">14-df-heyting-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上的预层。子对象以实际子预层表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,T\\subseteq P\">\\(A,B,T\\subseteq P\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_i)\">\\((A_i)\\)</span> 为子预层族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_P,1_P,\\wedge,\\bigvee,\\Rightarrow_P\">\\(0_P,1_P,\\wedge,\\bigvee,\\Rightarrow_P\\)</span> 为以下构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0_P(C)=\\varnothing,\\qquad1_P(C)=P(C),\\qquad(A\\wedge B)(C)=A(C)\\cap B(C),\\qquad(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}A_i)(C)=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0_P(C)=\\varnothing,\\qquad1_P(C)=P(C),\\qquad(A\\wedge B)(C)=A(C)\\cap B(C),\\qquad(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}A_i)(C)=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\Rightarrow_P B)(C)=\\{p\\in P(C)\\mid\\forall u:D\\to C\\;(P(u)p\\in A(D)\\Rightarrow P(u)p\\in B(D))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\Rightarrow_P B)(C)=\\{p\\in P(C)\\mid\\forall u:D\\to C\\;(P(u)p\\in A(D)\\Rightarrow P(u)p\\in B(D))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_PA=A\\Rightarrow_P0_P,\\qquad T\\subseteq(A\\Rightarrow_PB)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\cap A\\subseteq B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_PA=A\\Rightarrow_P0_P,\\qquad T\\subseteq(A\\Rightarrow_PB)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\cap A\\subseteq B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(x\\mapsto P(u)(x)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\left\\{0_P,1_P,A\\wedge B,\\bigvee_{i\\in I}A_i,A\\Rightarrow_P B,\\neg_PA\\right\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(x\\mapsto P(u)(x)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\left\\{0_P,1_P,A\\wedge B,\\bigvee_{i\\in I}A_i,A\\Rightarrow_P B,\\neg_PA\\right\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每项都在限制下封闭。尤其蕴含式必须对所有进一步限制量化，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上使用集合蕴含会破坏子预层条件。最后的伴随式可直接证明：向右在恒等箭头处应用定义；向左利用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的限制稳定性。于是它给出 Heyting 蕴含。任意小交也逐点计算，子预层全体构成完备 Heyting 代数。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.8, pp.54–56。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"91189e210bff4156","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-algebra]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,T\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"(A_i)","display":false},{"tex":"0_P,1_P,\\wedge,\\bigvee,\\Rightarrow_P","display":false},{"tex":"0_P(C)=\\varnothing,\\qquad1_P(C)=P(C),\\qquad(A\\wedge B)(C)=A(C)\\cap B(C),\\qquad(\\bigvee_{i\\in I}A_i)(C)=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A_i(C).","display":true},{"tex":"(A\\Rightarrow_P B)(C)=\\{p\\in P(C)\\mid\\forall u:D\\to C\\;(P(u)p\\in A(D)\\Rightarrow P(u)p\\in B(D))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg_PA=A\\Rightarrow_P0_P,\\qquad T\\subseteq(A\\Rightarrow_PB)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\cap A\\subseteq B.","display":true},{"tex":"K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(x\\mapsto P(u)(x)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\left\\{0_P,1_P,A\\wedge B,\\bigvee_{i\\in I}A_i,A\\Rightarrow_P B,\\neg_PA\\right\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false}],"bytes":1947,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations|df-194 — 预层子对象的 Heyting 运算]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-heyting-operations|df-194 — 预层子对象的 Heyting 运算]]"}],"outgoing":["300365f146cacc8a","91189e210bff4156"]}